<title>UK: Gulf Canada has 98.4 pct of Clyde.</title>
<headline>Gulf Canada has 98.4 pct of Clyde.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf Canada Resources Ltd said on Tuesday it had acquired or received acceptances for around 98.4 percent of Clyde Petroleum Plc's share capital.</p>
<p>The Canadian oil group won control of British oil and gas exploration firm Clyde in mid-February after a protracted takeover battle.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
